{"unit_id":"tag:08MC:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为环化拓扑斯（ringed topoi）的一阶加厚（first order thickening）。假设给定扩张（extensions）\n<MATHSEG_0001>及<MATHSEG_0002>\n（如（<REF_0001>）中所述），以及映射（maps）<MATH_0002>与<MATH_0003>。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 如果存在<MATH_0004>-模映射（module map）<MATH_0005>，与<MATH_0006>及<MATH_0007>相容，则图（diagram）\n<MATH_0008>\n是交换的（commutative）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 集合（set）由与<MATH_0011>及<MATH_0012>相容的<MATH_0009>-模（module）映射（maps）<MATH_0010>组成；若它非空（nonempty），则在<MATH_0013>作用下为主齐性空间（principal homogeneous space）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"环化拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"module map","target_term":"模映射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换的"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"nonempty","target_term":"非空"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous space","target_term":"主齐性空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"环化拓扑斯","context":"加厚的对象"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚","context":"所给加厚"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张","context":"给定的两个模扩张"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"扩张端点及中间项之间的映射"},{"source_term":"module map","target_term":"模映射","context":"中间项的相容映射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"由扩张诱导的图"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换的","context":"图的交换性"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"相容映射的集合"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"中间项的模结构"},{"source_term":"nonempty","target_term":"非空","context":"相容映射集合的非空条件"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous space","target_term":"主齐性空间","context":"群在相容映射集合上的作用"}],"notes":[]}
