{"unit_id":"tag:08MD:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为环化拓扑斯（ringed topoi）的一阶加厚（first order thickening）。假设给定扩张（extensions）\n<MATHSEG_0001>及<MATHSEG_0002>\n（如（<REF_0001>）中所述），以及映射（maps）<MATH_0002>与<MATH_0003>。假设图（diagram）\n<MATH_0004>\n是交换的（commutative）。于是存在元素（element）\n<MATH_0005>\n，其为零是存在映射（map）<MATH_0006>与<MATH_0007>及<MATH_0008>相容的充分必要条件。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"环化拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换的"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"环化拓扑斯","context":"加厚的对象"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚","context":"给定加厚"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张","context":"所给两个扩张"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"端点之间的映射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"所给相容性图"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换的","context":"图的交换性假设"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"存在性的障碍元素"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"中间项之间的相容映射"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08MD:proof","translation":"可以显式构造扩张（extension）\n<MATH_0001>\n，方法是取<MATH_0002>为复形（complex）\n<MATH_0003>\n在中间的上同调（cohomology）（使用显然的记号）。利用引理中的图（diagram）交换（commutes）这一假设作局部截面（local sections）的计算，可见<MATH_0004>被<MATH_0005>零化。因此，<MATH_0006>定义<MATH_0007>中的一个类（class）。最后，<MATH_0008>的类（class）是扩张（extension）<MATH_0009>经<MATH_0010>所得的推出（pushout）与扩张（extension）<MATH_0011>经<MATH_0012>所得的拉回（pullback）之差（略去计算）。因此，<MATH_0013>的类（class）为零等价于（equivalent）所求的交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0014>\n存在。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"local sections","target_term":"局部截面"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"pushout","target_term":"推出"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价于"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张","context":"所构造的模扩张"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"定义中间上同调的复形"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"复形在中间项的上同调"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"假设交换的图"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"该图的交换性"},{"source_term":"local sections","target_term":"局部截面","context":"用于检验零化性质的截面"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类","context":"扩张给出的上同调类"},{"source_term":"pushout","target_term":"推出","context":"沿系数映射变换扩张"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回","context":"沿商映射变换扩张"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价于","context":"障碍为零与图存在的等价"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"