{"unit_id":"tag:08ME:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为环化拓扑斯（ringed topoi）的一阶加厚（first order thickening）。假设给定<MATH_0002>-模（modules）<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004>，以及<MATH_0005>-线性（linear）映射（map）\n<MATH_0006>\n。若存在序列（sequence）（<REF_0001>），满足<MATH_0007>，则这些扩张（extensions）的同构类（isomorphism classes）的集合（set）在<MATH_0008>作用下为主齐性（principal homogeneous）的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"环化拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"序列"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous","target_term":"主齐性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"环化拓扑斯","context":"所给加厚的对象"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚","context":"所给加厚"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"给定的两个模"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性","context":"所给模映射的线性性"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"所给线性映射"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"序列","context":"所要求的扩张序列"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张","context":"待分类的扩张"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类","context":"扩张按同构分类"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"扩张的同构类集合"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous","target_term":"主齐性","context":"给定群在扩张类上的作用"}],"notes":[]}
